        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khunyanga yekhumi nakharaano eyomumwesi kwomusaafu, mube nomukhung'aano omutakatifu; murakholakhwo omulimo kwosi kwobukhalabani ta, nebutswa mukholele OMWAMI lisabo tsindaalo musaafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
